    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Cecile has agreed to work with Mathias, and Gabriel feels betrayed. Back at the agency, their argument brings Andrea into the dispute, before Mathias tells her who revealed the bad news to Cecile. Listen to the exchange in French first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "Merci, Mathias! Tu as volé Cécile!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "Et ne dis pas que c'était pour le bien de l'agence.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mathias",
      "t": "Bien sûr que oui, Gabriel.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mathias",
      "t": "Deux autres agences voulaient Cécile.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "Encore vingt-quatre heures, et elle revient!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mathias",
      "t": "On n'avait pas vingt-quatre heures.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "Ce n'est pas un dossier. C'est Cécile.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mathias",
      "t": "Oui, c'est Cécile.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "andrea",
      "t": "Félicitations, Mathias.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "andrea",
      "t": "Tu as volé la star de Gabriel avec beaucoup de classe.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "andrea",
      "t": "Tu es fier de toi?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mathias",
      "t": "J'ai sauvé une cliente de l'agence, c'est tout.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mathias",
      "t": "Maintenant, laisse-moi te dire un truc.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mathias",
      "t": "Ta nouvelle assistante a dit à Cécile qu'elle est trop vieille.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "andrea",
      "t": "Camille? Mais pourquoi?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mathias",
      "t": "Tu l'as trouvée où? Elle est dangereuse.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mathias",
      "t": "Gabriel ne sait rien. Mais règle ce problème très vite!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mathias",
      "t": "Bonne journée.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's go back over it. Gabriel starts with a thank-you, but he doesn't mean it at all.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "Merci, Mathias!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thanks, Mathias!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "Tu as volé Cécile!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You stole Cecile!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "Et ne dis pas que c'était pour le bien de l'agence.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And don't say it was for the good of the agency.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mathias",
      "t": "Bien sûr que oui, Gabriel.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Of course it was, Gabriel.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mathias",
      "t": "Deux autres agences voulaient Cécile.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Two other agencies wanted Cecile.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "Encore vingt-quatre heures, et elle revient!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Twenty-four more hours, and she comes back!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mathias",
      "t": "On n'avait pas vingt-quatre heures.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We didn't have twenty-four hours.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "Ce n'est pas un dossier. C'est Cécile.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She's not a file. She's Cecile.'",
