      "t": "Félicitations, Mathias.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Congratulations, Mathias.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "andrea",
      "t": "Tu as volé la star de Gabriel avec beaucoup de classe.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You stole Gabriel's star with a lot of class.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "andrea",
      "t": "Tu es fier de toi?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you proud of yourself?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mathias",
      "t": "J'ai sauvé une cliente de l'agence, c'est tout.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I saved one of the agency's clients, that's all.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mathias",
      "t": "Maintenant, laisse-moi te dire un truc.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Now, let me tell you something.'",
